From 08172e31c30ccc33ddf1cf0e7580cc151c63c0a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: legsmechanical <joshgaine@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 9 Jun 2026 23:34:28 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(fx):=20Move-track=20channel=20strips=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20independent=20Move=20FX=20slots?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Under Move>Schwung (rebuild_from_la), each synth slot's Move>Slot toggle
(default On) decides whether the same-channel Move track is summed into the
synth slot (shares its FX + sends, prior behavior) or peeled off to a
dedicated Move FX slot. Four Move FX slots (1:1 per channel), each an
audio-FX-only mini-bus with up to MOVE_FX_BLOCKS (2) insert FX, its own
volume, and Send A/B feeding the global return buses.

- Data: shadow_chain_slot_t.move_to_slot; shadow_move_fx_slots[4][2] +
  shadow_move_fx_strip[]; loaders + shadow_move_fx_has_fx() in chain mgmt.
- Shim: conditional synth+Move sum; inline Move FX branch in the rebuild
  loop; generalized accumulate_sends_ex shared by synth + Move FX slots.
- Params: slot:move_to_slot; move_fx:N:fxM:* + move_fx:N:volume|send_a|send_b
  (generic fxN parse bounded by MOVE_FX_BLOCKS); shared fx_slot_param_rest.
- Persistence: per-set slot_move_to_slot + move_fx_<slot>_<block>.json /
  move_fx_meta.json (save/restore/duplicate/new-set parity with send FX).
- UI: Move>Slot in the chain settings menu; Move FX buses in the FX bus
  picker + slots list; editor renders activeFxBus.components; per-bus
  "Configure <bus> FX" settings label.

Block count is a single knob (MOVE_FX_BLOCKS / MOVE_FX_BLOCKS_JS) so a fork
can raise it to 4. Hardware-verified on official (2-effect, send-fx-official base).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
